153
00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:32.420
So then when he finds the beloved yogurt lid and Karen has just ditched him for her girlfriends,

154
00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.300
I think it was a real aha moment for him.

155
00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:35.900
Huh.

156
00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:36.560
Mm-hmm.

157
00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.760
I mean, I can see the aha moment.

158
00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:48.100
