161
00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:55.580
She was cool.

162
00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:56.740
She was making jokes.

163
00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.480
They don't want to do the same things.

164
00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.740
They are just like, they are not a match.

165
00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.400
It was so clear to me when I re-watched this episode.

166
00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.580
Because she's a catch.

167
00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.240
She's a total catch.

168
00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:07.920
Yeah, she's not his person.

169
00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:10.880
No, he's not like charmed by her the way he should be.

170
00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:15.100
Well, there's like that thing, you know, where it's like when you're really into someone,

171
00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.500
