254
00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:09.330
Welcome to Office, ladies.

255
00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:10.930
Hello, Jenna Fisher.

256
00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:12.770
Hello, Angela Kinsey.

257
00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:14.030
Thank you for having me.

258
00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.010
Oh, thanks so much for being on.

259
00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:16.930
My pleasure.

260
00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:19.030
We're so excited to have you today.

261
00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:19.990
Thank you.

262
00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:21.550
I'm excited to be here.

263
00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:22.230
Good.

264
00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:28.390
We were texting, and I know you were texting with Angela as well, and you told us that you

265
00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:35.410
have not seen an episode of the show since it aired, but that you were going to watch the

