1054
00:52:54.510 --> 00:52:54.970
It's still there.

1055
00:52:55.350 --> 00:52:56.370
That's so fun.

1056
00:52:56.530 --> 00:52:57.350
That's so fun.

1057
00:52:57.530 --> 00:52:59.050
