1203
01:00:13.410 --> 01:00:13.850
Yeah.

1204
01:00:14.250 --> 01:00:14.670
Best part.

1205
01:00:14.790 --> 01:00:16.150
I make $80,000 a year.

1206
01:00:16.730 --> 01:00:17.130
Now, Jenna.

1207
01:00:17.790 --> 01:00:18.890
So here's the thing.

1208
01:00:18.890 --> 01:00:26.590
I, I saw online that fans of The Office were like, you know, if you divide 80,000 by 12,

1209
01:00:26.890 --> 01:00:31.610
you get like 6666.666667 or something like that.

1210
01:00:31.750 --> 01:00:34.070
