1222
01:01:03.470 --> 01:01:05.490
I don't think I would want to have a salary.

1223
01:01:05.650 --> 01:01:06.770
I wouldn't want to get checks.

1224
01:01:07.270 --> 01:01:09.710
I mean, I guess you take out the taxes and everything.

1225
01:01:10.030 --> 01:01:11.330
